ARTOMETRICS GLOSSARY — PLACEHOLDER STUB
This is not a binary Adobe Photoshop file.
It is a text brief saved as .psd so an agent can find it next to the HTML starter.
Do not expect Photoshop to open it as vectors or layers.

Style: Impressionism
Board: /styles/impressionism
Companions: impressionism-starter.html, impressionism-study.ai, impressionism-study.psd

Document
3000 × 1800 px, 300 ppi. Ground #d5e2ea, not white.

Layer stack, top to bottom
- Labels (two words maximum)
- Warm notes, few, #c9843a and #f4d7a1
- Water touches, #6f92a8, #355872, #d7e4ee
- Field touches, #7f9e7a, #c4b07a, #6e8f84
- Sky touches
- Ground

Rules
Each touch is its own short mark. Do not use one soft brush that blends the whole sky.
No contour layer. No copied painting under the stack.
Not a pointillist layer of dots.
